    "detailed_description": "ParaPerspective is a puzzle game where moving the camera affects the state of the world, by rotating it around you can create geometrically impossible connections.<br><br>When you align blocks, slopes and stairs to make them <strong>appear</strong> connected, they <strong>become</strong> connected. Even gravity itself is affected, making you fall on what <strong>seems</strong> to be below you. The game is divided in worlds that provide you with loads of bite-sized puzzles that you can solve at your own pace. Skip to the next one if you can't figure this one out, and come back later!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make your own levels</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997290/extras/1d3c5fda5228a442ef48b47d18186a84.avif?t=1710778557\" /></div><br>With the in-game editor, you can easily make and share levels! It's simple and intuitive, the levels can be shared with your friends as a string of text or as png card, just like the one below!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997290/extras/d080fa096b630f1d7a0ced90320ba78e.avif?t=1710778557\" /></div>",
